Wrong Turn 4: Bloody Beginnings is a 2011 slasher film
written and directed by Declan O'Brien.

12
00:58:44,210 --> 00:58:50,210
It is the fourth installment of the Wrong Turn film series and served as
the first part of a prequel to the Wrong Turn (2003).

13
01:03:37,894 --> 01:03:43,894
Starring Jennifer Pudavick, Tenika Davis, Kaitlyn Wong, and Terra Vnesa, the film follows a group of college students who get lost in a storm
during a snowmobile trip and take shelter in an abandoned sanatorium that, unbeknownst to them, is home to deformed cannibals.

14
